        <p>_ . It is admitted by the entire jewellery trade that we have the Largest Stock of Gold Alberts in Liverpool. Over 1,000 to select from. Value undeniable. SPECIAL OFFER.—A Gent's Solid Gold Albert. Govern- ment stamped each link, over one ounce in weight, £2 3s 6d. Valuables of all kinds Purchased, Exchanged, Sold on Commission, or received (in a confidential manner) vs Security for Cash Advances. Any of the above forwarded on approval carriage paid to any address. Quote Number and Article, SEND FOR OUR MONTHLY LIsT OF FORFEITED BARGAINS, POST FRB&amp; Established 1821, Telephone 5,949. HARRIS'S, 28-30, BERRY STREET, LIVERPOOL</p>
