        <p>DRAWING-ROOM FITRNITURE.—Genoa Velvet Suite. cost £l5, for £7 106. Artistic Suite in rich covering, cost £lB,,for £9 9.. Very effective inlaid Suite, cost £2O for £lO 10s. Beautiful Inlaid Rose wood Suits in Silk cost £22, for Ell lls. Rxquisitely-carved Dark Mahogany Suite, cost £27, for £l4 14s. Graceful Walnut Suite, really beautifully finished, coot £3O„ for £l6 16s. Lovely Suite, mot £35, for £lB. Cabinet, tasteful design, cost £3, for £3 10s. Another larger, £4 15s. Chippendale Cabinet, numerous mirrors, carved brackets, Zee., cost, £l2, £6 66. Inlaid Rosewood Cabinet, cost £l6 for £8 86. Chippendale, Dark Mahogany, cost £2O, for £lO 10s. French style, very choice, £2.5, for £l3 13. Ovtrmantel, neat design £2 103 ; rpore elaborate, £3 10s, coat double. Walnut Overmantel, very nicely finished, cost £lO, for £1 15s. Genuine Oak, chastely carved, cost £l5, for £5 10s.</p>
        <p>BEDROOM FURNITURE.—WaInut Suite, All requisite articles, cost £l6, for £8 Bs. Another, cost £lB, for £lO 10s. Satin Walnut butte cost MO, for Ell 11s, Mahcgany Suite, consists of roomy wardrobe, with bevelled plate-glass door, dressing chest, with bevelled swing mirror, jewel boxes, washstand, with marble slab, the bask, with levelled plate over, pedestal rail, and two chairs ; cost £24, for £l2 12s. Handsome Ash Suite, cost £3O. for £l5. beautiful Walnut Suite, coot £35, for £l7 17s. Magnificent Italian Walnut Suite. Cost £4O for £22 106. Noble Satin Waleut Suite, cost £5O, for £27 10s. Extremely Ornate Walnut Suite. profusely carved panels, fine esign, and rare workmanship, cost £6O, for £32. Richly-figured Spanish Mahogany Suite, cost £7O, for £36. Grand Dark Mahogr.ny Chippendale Suite, cost £9O, for £43. Scores of others.</p>
